{
 "rule": "negotiation",
 "classes": [
  "Negotiation"
 ],
 "note": "Finding out what a provider accepts, by being refused (spec/translation-file is not concerned: this is the request's shape). `run` plays a script on ONE negotiation (new, for the provider `http://server|model`): a step is a refusal `{refusal, structured}` (the body of a 400/422; `structured` = the request carried a response format), a `{forget: providerAndModel}`, or a `{look}`; each answers the state after it (and, for a refusal, `concession`: Made | ResponseFormat | NothingLeft). Words observed, not designed: the cap, the seed and the temperature are the ones the original refusals named (OpenAI-style wording quoted in the first checks); the response format's (`response_format`, `json_schema`) come from the Manager's stand-in server only — no real server's refusal has been captured yet. What is kept (the cap's field, a dropped temperature, a dropped seed, the reasoning rung) is forgotten when the provider or the model changes; a refusal of the response format is never kept.",
 "operations": {
  "run": {
   "in": {
    "steps": "[{refusal, structured?} | {forget} | {look}]"
   },
   "out": "[state after each step: {token_field, send_temperature, send_seed, send_stream_usage, reasoning_effort}, plus `concession` for a refusal]"
  },
  "is_about_our_request": {
   "in": {
    "status": "int"
   },
   "out": "bool"
  }
 },
 "cases": [
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/the-first-request",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "look": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none"
    }
   ],
   "why": "the cap goes in max_tokens (every compatible server understands it; the newer name is accepted and IGNORED by some), temperature is sent, a seed may be sent (only a retranslation asks for one), reasoning is asked to stand down: the best rung"
  },
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/the-server-names-the-cap",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "refusal": "Unsupported parameter: use max_completion_tokens",
      "structured": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_completion_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none",
     "concession": "Made"
    }
   ],
   "why": "the field the server NAMED is what changes, and the reasoning rung is not touched: one variable per attempt or we learn nothing"
  },
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/the-server-names-the-temperature",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "refusal": "temperature does not support 0.0 with this model",
      "structured": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": false,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none",
     "concession": "Made"
    }
   ],
   "why": "a refused temperature is dropped, its own default applies, and the line still gets translated; the seed is kept — it was not named"
  },
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/the-server-names-the-seed",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "refusal": "Unrecognized request argument supplied: seed",
      "structured": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": false, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none",
     "concession": "Made"
    }
   ],
   "why": "a refused seed is dropped and the temperature kept: the variation comes from the temperature, the seed only makes it reproducible where honoured"
  },
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/nothing-named-walks-the-ladder",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "refusal": "bad request",
      "structured": false
     },
     {
      "refusal": "bad request",
      "structured": false
     },
     {
      "refusal": "bad request",
      "structured": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "low",
     "concession": "Made"
    },
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": null,
     "concession": "Made"
    },
    {
     "token_field": "max_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": null,
     "concession": "NothingLeft"
    }
   ],
   "why": "with nothing named reasoning steps down (none, low), then the field goes away entirely (some models reject the parameter outright), then there is nothing left: the failure was never about our parameters"
  },
  {
   "id": "negotiation/run/three-concessions-on-one-unhappy-model",
   "op": "run",
   "in": {
    "steps": [
     {
      "refusal": "max_completion_tokens is required",
      "structured": false
     },
     {
      "refusal": "temperature is not supported",
      "structured": false
     },
     {
      "refusal": "reasoning_effort invalid",
      "structured": false
     }
    ]
   },
   "out": [
    {
     "token_field": "max_completion_tokens",
     "send_temperature": true,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none",
     "concession": "Made"
    },
    {
     "token_field": "max_completion_tokens",
     "send_temperature": false,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "none",
     "concession": "Made"
    },
    {
     "token_field": "max_completion_tokens",
     "send_temperature": false,
     "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true,
     "reasoning_effort": "low",
     "concession": "Made"
    }
   ],
   "why": "each concession costs something, none of them costs the answer"
  },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/the-server-names-stream-options", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "Unrecognized request argument supplied: stream_options", "structured": false } ] },
    "out": [ { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" } ],
    "why": "a server that does not know the option for a token count at the end of a stream gets the question without it: one variable, the reasoning rung is not touched" },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/the-server-names-include-usage-only", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "include_usage is not supported", "structured": false } ] },
    "out": [ { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" } ],
    "why": "either of its two names says it: a server may quote the field inside the option" },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/stream-options-before-the-seed-and-the-temperature", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "stream_options, seed and temperature are not supported", "structured": false }, { "refusal": "stream_options, seed and temperature are not supported", "structured": false }, { "refusal": "stream_options, seed and temperature are not supported", "structured": false } ] },
    "out": [
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" },
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": false, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" },
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": false, "send_seed": false, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" } ],
    "why": "a body naming several fields costs the answer nothing for the first, and its variation only for the last: the option for the token count goes first, then the seed, then the temperature" },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/the-cap-comes-before-stream-options", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "use max_completion_tokens; stream_options is rejected", "structured": false }, { "refusal": "use max_completion_tokens; stream_options is rejected", "structured": false } ] },
    "out": [
      { "token_field": "max_completion_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" },
      { "token_field": "max_completion_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" } ],
    "why": "the cap's field keeps its place: one change per attempt, in the order the rule has always had" },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/stream-options-is-given-up-once", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "stream_options rejected", "structured": false }, { "refusal": "stream_options rejected", "structured": false } ] },
    "out": [
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" },
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "low", "concession": "Made" } ],
    "why": "once dropped it is no more to give up: a second refusal that names nothing else is the reasoning's, as for any body that names nothing we know" },
  { "id": "negotiation/run/a-change-of-provider-brings-stream-options-back", "op": "run",
    "in": { "steps": [ { "refusal": "stream_options rejected", "structured": false }, { "forget": "http://elsewhere|other-model" } ] },
    "out": [
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": false, "reasoning_effort": "none", "concession": "Made" },
      { "token_field": "max_tokens", "send_temperature": true, "send_seed": true, "send_stream_usage": true, "reasoning_effort": "none" } ],
    "why": "what one server refuses says nothing about the next" },
